WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.875
- So I'm like, "Coach, I'm not missing the Met Gala for a BROWNS game.”
[Group laughs]

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.750
- Oh, what’s up, boys? We talking about

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.166
[Mispronouncing] Why-ves Saint Laurent?
[Group laughs]

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.625
- Sorry, the Receiver Club is for smart and classy positions.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.791
- Yeah, I don’t think the Seahawks even have a tight end.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.750
- I’ll show them smart and classy.

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:16.125
Yo, guys!
[Group gasps]

00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:18.375
- SOME FACES NEED BEARDS.

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:21.041
- We have to prove we're not just dumb linemen with hands.

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:21.875
- [Together:] HEAR, HEAR!

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.041
- It’s time to start…

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.000
TIGHT END UNIVERSITY.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:26.875
- WHERE’D TRAVIS GO?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.791
- ALL RIGHT, RECRUITS, SING IT WITH ME.

00:00:31.791 --> 00:00:37.541
- [Together:] ♪♪♪ AT T.E.U, WE HONOR THEE  PASS-BLOCKING TRUE BELIEVERS ♪♪♪

00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:39.125
- So how long do we have to be stuck together?

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:44.625
- ♪♪♪ WE’RE LIKE LINEMEN, BUT HERE’S THE CATCH: WE’RE ELIGIBLE RECEIVERS ♪♪♪

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:45.541
- I heard there was a party.

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.541
- [Together:] Super senior Jimmy Graham!

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.000
- ♪♪♪ CATCH, BLOCK, CATCH, BLOCK, DO YOU KNOW WHAT THE CALL IS? ♪♪♪

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:56.000
♪♪♪ IT DOESN’T MATTER, JUST ACT LIKE TONY GONZALEZ! ♪♪♪

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.250
- I haven’t been this emotional since WrestleMania XIX.

00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:02.000
- FUNDRAISER SO WE CAN BUY MORE BACKWARDS HATS!

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:04.166
- Sup...we’re here to save your party.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.291
- Uh, Noah Fant? No-Ah can't let you in.

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:06.750
[Group gasps]

00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:09.625
- There’s nothing we can do. Technically, it's an accredited university.

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.416
- Nick's description of Gatsby is just so inconsistent.

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:17.000
- PERHAPS NICK CARRAWAY...IS UNRELIABLE NARRATOR?

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.125
- [Together:] OHHHH.

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.916
- You vs. Us. The Annual Touchdown Dance.

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:24.166
You win the crown, and we’ll go the way of the fullback and just disappear.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.250
- Come with us, kid.

00:01:25.416 --> 00:01:26.250
- Oh, I’m a tight end.

00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:26.916
- [Together:] WHAT?!?!

00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:28.666
- Dang. One day.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.000
- WELCOME TO THE TOUCHDOWN DANCE!

00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:33.375
- Ooof, is this what Cam is doin' these days?

00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:35.750
- SHOW. US. THAT. SWAG.
♪♪♪

00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:41.750
Yo, this dude's intense as hell.

00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:45.375
Oh, it’s like a two-person scene. Cute.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.125
- All right. Come on, Killer Trav. It’s all up to you.

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:50.000
- It’s not goosey. It’s GUCCI.

00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:53.166
- Tyreek is Cheetah, and Travis is THE WARTHOG!

00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:56.250
- It’s your brother, Jason. F--k you. Catching is for pretty boys.

00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:57.916
- All right, the call of the tight end:

00:01:58.125 --> 00:01:58.916
WOOOOO!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:01:59.875
- [Together:] WOOOOOO!!!

00:02:11.416 --> 00:02:15.125
- I’d like to announce that I’m officially stepping down as head coach of the Jacksonville Jaguars.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:18.166
I’ll be going back to college to become the coach of Tight End University.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.833
- It’s not a power 5 school!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:20.291
- What?

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.375
I’d like to announce my total and complete commitment to the Jacksonville Jaguars.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.875
Go…[sigh]...Duval.

